      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CALZO SNIPER (2) is in good form at present having placed in all of his three career runs. Finished second at his latest appearance over 1609m at this track, beaten 5.5 metres when trying to lead all of the way. Will enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position. Meets a comparable field and he can take this race out. LOTSEVEN (6) made a nice return at his latest appearance three weeks ago, finishing 4.5 metres away in second over 1680m at Launceston. Needs to be at his best to beat this field but he has the ability to mix it with them. CLAYTON (5) finished second last start in a Listed feature won by Cardigan Sniper over 1720m at Melton, beaten 5.5 metres. Ready to run another big race in this weaker affair. HEY POSTER BOY (1) did not make an impact last start but strips fitter third-up and can finish in the money.",
